        <mxCell id="RtxvCn60XcCwyURXBxNb-395" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;1: Year and month.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2: Will use a stored procedure for creating a new record where it is required to pass it the ranking/order value.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3: Will use a stored procedure for updating this ranking/order value which will increase or decrease all other record rankings that are affected by the change.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4: The order should be based on primarily the end date, but should also consider priority.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5: Can be both an image and a video.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
